        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 310.36,
          "end": 313.56,
          "en": "and now became part of the interface.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 313.56,
          "end": 314.77,
          "en": "And this can be achieved by",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 314.77,
          "end": 318.97,
          "en": "adding an empty array of dependencies to use effect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 318.97,
          "end": 321.66,
          "en": "Then this effect function will only execute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
